{
  "slug": "n360-engineering",
  "name": "N360 Engineering",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Zero-defect engineering standard for Claude Code. Enforces session discipline with structured start/end procedures, TDD with red-green-refactor cycles, evidence-based investigation protocol, circuit breakers that stop token burn on unsolvable problems, security baselines, performance targets, rollback playbooks, and observability requirements. Built by Nucleus360 for teams where code quality is non-negotiable.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `large-feature` (Use when a feature touches 5+ files, involves multiple layers (API + DB + frontend), or will take…), `operating-standard` (Use at every session start and throughout all development work), `tdd` (Use when implementing any new feature, endpoint, service method, or critical flow)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install n360-engineering@claude-community` from `JPVT1977/n360-marketplace` (`plugins/n360-engineering`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
